*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local

# Memory archive. The default MEMORY_STORE_PATH is <OPENCODE_DIRECTORY>/mem/memory.db,
# and OPENCODE_DIRECTORY defaults to ".", so a default deployment writes the
# conversation archive into the repository root. It holds private conversation
# text, so it must never be committed.
mem/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# SSH private keys — never commit these
huoshanyun*
hunshanyun*
*.pem
id_rsa
id_ed25519

# Test coverage
*.cover
coverage.txt

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
node_modules

# Local scratch files under test/. These are personal debugging helpers, not
# part of the test suite, and they do not compile as a package (duplicate
# main functions), so `go build ./...` fails while they are present. Keep them
# on disk but out of the repository.
test/test1.go
test/viewer.go
